# Claude Code runtime state (~/.claude is stowed from claude/) — only curated config is tracked
claude/.claude/*
!claude/.claude/hooks/
!claude/.claude/settings.json
!claude/.claude/settings.local.json.example

# Codex runtime state (~/.codex is stowed from codex/) — auth.json holds credentials, never commit
codex/.codex/*
!codex/.codex/AGENTS.md
!codex/.codex/hooks.json
!codex/.codex/hooks/
# skills/ is mostly content-addressed symlinks into ~/.local/share/hero-agent;
# only hand-written skills are tracked
!codex/.codex/skills/
codex/.codex/skills/*
!codex/.codex/skills/README.md
!codex/.codex/skills/config-hygiene/
!codex/.codex/skills/simplify/
